abstract: "Code, data and results for a study of how a denoise, sharpen and adaptive-threshold pipeline (100 parameter combinations) affects the recognition of handwritten student names and 12-digit Learner Reference Numbers (LRNs) by three open-source OCR engines (Tesseract, EasyOCR and PaddleOCR). The repository contains the experiment program, the analysis program, 30 photographs of answer sheets with fictitious names and LRNs, and the ground truth and paper condition of each sheet."
